# Platform Readiness Roadmap batch pull requests

Each **batch PR** (up to five top-level task codes) is the **implementation ticket**. Do not open one PR per task unless the user explicitly asks.

## Do

- Branch: `cursor/platform-readiness/s{nn}-b{n}-5329` (see `prd-pr-batches.ts`).
- Title: `PRD S{n} B{n} {section title} ({task range})`.
- Body: Who / What / Where / Why / When / How and **Done when** from `platform-readiness-catalog.ts` for **every task in the batch**.
- Merge with green CI to mark those task codes complete on the Platform Readiness board (`?catalog=prd`).

## CLM overlap (Option A — locked in)

Do **not** implement CLM §1–2 tasks. They are pointers only; execution is **PRD only**. See `docs/internal/platform-readiness-vs-clm.md`.

## Internal docs (section 6)

- `docs/internal/security-questionnaire-starter.md` — task 6.2
- `docs/internal/buyer-demo-script.md` — task 6.4
- `docs/internal/workspace-isolation-note.md` — task 1.4

